---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <main class="page-block">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      Project Vibrare is a personal study notebook on music theory and composition. It collects notes on
      tonal harmony, partimento, counterpoint and fugue, along with analysis of Bach and of the music of
      the Touhou Project.
    </p>
    <p>
      Alongside the notes there are small music-theory tools, a glossary, a list of resources for further
      study, and a collection of arrangements.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
